SUBST:   o = t, p = G, q = w, r = W, s = l
SUBST:   J = x, K = c, L = v, MN = m, O = 1, P = 2, Q = 3, RS = b
CLEAR:   -
SHUFFLE: AACCTTUUVYYdeefghi, tGGwWlI, xxccvvbbmm+123
